  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2105.03 Procedure for Hearing. All hearings conducted by the commissioner as required by RSA 159:6-b shall be in accordance with the department of safety's general rules for procedure for hearings, Saf-C 200.\n\nSource. #10380, eff 7-17-13 (from Saf-C 2106.01); ss by #13881, eff 2-20-24",
